    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "new goals. that's the problem. i've had new goals for a decade. i kept telling myself once i hit this level, things would feel different, like i'd finally be \"done\" or satisfied. but now that i'm actually here, i just feel like a ghost. there's nothing left to strive for. it feels like i've reached the end of the road and there's just... nothingness waiting.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
